Package: mutt
Title: Curated Microbiome Taxonomic Profiles and Microbial Load Measurements
Version: 0.1.0.9001
Authors@R: c(person("Maxwell", "Konnaris", email = "mak6930@psu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")), person("Justin", "Silverman", email = "JustinSilverman@psu.edu", role = c("aut", "ctb")))
Description: Retrieves curated, versioned microbiome study datasets pairing
    taxonomic profiles with microbial-load measurements. Only requested studies
    are downloaded from pinned releases, verified with SHA-256 and cached locally.
    Source metadata and transparent study-specific preprocessing recipes support
    reproducibility without requiring preprocessing for normal use.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Silverman-Lab/mutt
BugReports: https://github.com/Silverman-Lab/mutt/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: digest, jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr, phyloseq,
    TreeSummarizedExperiment, S4Vectors
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
